      "zotero_refs": "[RCJ46BHM]: 337 also records the lineage of Madhyamaka from Jo bo D\u012bpa\u1e43kara (ID:3745) according to Mi bskyod rdo rje (ID:6895): N\u0101ga (ID:3720), \u0100ryadeva (ID:3702), Candrak\u012brti (ID:3725), Rig pa'i khu byug che (*Vidy\u0101kokila) (ID:7788), (Rig pa'i khu byug) chung (i.e. a wa d+hu ti) (ID:7963), Jo bo Atisha (ID:3745), sTon pa chen po (i.e., 'Brom ston rGyal ba'i 'byung gnas) (ID:3827), sPyan snga ba (Tshul khrims 'bar) (ID:3830), Bya yul pa (ID:3915). Then from many unspecified bKa\u2019 gdams pa masters to Lord sGam po pa (ID:4189). \r\n\r\nAlternatively, from Bo to ba (i.e. Po to ba) (ID:3829), Sha ra ba (ID:3869), to Dus gsum mkhyen pa (ID:3855), and from him it is then the same as the first lineage of N\u0101ropa (ID:5639) according to Mi bskyod rdo rje (ID:6895) (see [RCJ46BHM]: 329).",
